<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>YAF Star Farm (VIP)</Major>
    <Description>What it does?
Runs around covering most ground on the Roblox experience Yeet A Friend (YAF) to collect stars, which are used for buying upgrades, potions, wheel spins, energy, and unique pets. This is designed to work on 1 account while the other farms pets. My main use of this is to collect stars on 2 accounts (by switching off the order of accounts on the Desktops) and then use the stars to buy the unique pet every day on both accounts and trade them to my main account. Very effective.

Intended to work with 2 accounts:
Account 1: Run around collecting stars (auto)
Account 2: Farming pets for secrets

Requirements:
~ A computer that supports multiple desktops
~ 2 Roblox Accounts (download the launcher from roblox(dot)com and from an appstore like Microsoft App Store)
~ (not required but preferred) Upgraded Magnet Range
~ VIP gamepass for Yeet A Friend (for best results)

Setup: 
~ Open the Account you are farming stars for on Desktop 1 and the Other Account on Desktop 2.
~ Start the second account auto-ing pets and then switch to Desktop 1 before starting

Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
